  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "North of 30A in Rosemary Beach with access to all amenities, normal-size home with large backyard and driveway; large lot size unusual for RB and privacy (houses aren't on top of each other), backyard patio with sitting and eating areas and grill. In Rosemary Beach and you get access to everything. House has 8 beds (2 of these are bunk beds) and bunk bed room is suitable for additional kid sleeping. 3 Bedrooms (2 king masters one on main with own bathroom, one 2nd floor with own bathroom; 1 queen on 2nd floor that shares bathroom with bunk/sitting room) AND 4th room has bunk beds for 2 but you walk through it to get to the upper level king master. 3.5 baths total: 2 bathrooms on each floor: half-bath on first floor plus full bathroom connected to master; upstairs full bath off master plus additional full bath (with tub) shared by queen and bunk room. Sleeps 8 adults in beds (as long as 2 sleep in bunk beds) with extra room for children on floor in bunk room. Upstairs master and downstairs great room have wood-burning fireplace. The queen bedroom upstairs has a room-like deck off of it that contains a daybed. Total 4 decks (1 with daybed; 1 screened in porch downstairs, 1 large/open up top for lounging, 1 small porch off master downstairs). Flat screen TVs in all rooms but queen. Full kitchen, outdoor shower, parking for 3 cars. Couches in family room pull out to full beds, if necessary. Close to both indoor and outdoor pools, new St. Augustine Green park for kids and dogs, village (5 mins) and short walk (7-10 minutes) to beach through town. Comes with convenient beach buggy, 8 adult chairs, coolers, umbrella (all provided) to the beach - or option to rent chairs. North side of 30A has 2 pools (one inside/outside, one outside; both 5-7 min walk from the house) that are both 5 mins walks from house each way; also 5 min walk to gym/yoga studio and tennis courts. South side has 2 additional pools you have access to and the beach, of course.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
